:: Housekeeping Classroom
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">><<schooleffects>><<effects>><<set $bus to "housekeeping_classroom">>

<<if $schoolstate is "second" and [3, 5].includes(Time.weekDay)>>
	<!-- Note: until we separate the NPC introductions out of the <<npc>> widget, we must pay attention to where we use <<npc River>> in this passage. -->
	<!-- It would save several lines to simply put it here, but we can't. -->
	<<lockerClothesAutoEquip>>
	<<classRoomEarSlime "housekeeping">>
	<<if $worn.upper.type.includes("naked") and $worn.lower.type.includes("naked")>>
		<<outfitChecks>>
		/*Check for when the pc is only wearing an overcoat*/
		<<if $worn.under_upper.name isnot "naked" and $worn.under_lower.name isnot "naked">>
			<<set _naked to ($worn.under_upper.type.includes("swim") or $worn.under_lower.type.includes("swim")) ? "only wearing swimwear" : "only wearing underwear">>
		<<else>>
			<<set _naked to "not wearing anything">>
		<</if>>

		<<if $worn.over_upper.name isnot "naked" and $worn.over_lower.name isnot "naked">>
			<<set _overClothes to _middleOutfit ? $worn.over_upper.name : ($worn.over_upper.name + " and " + $worn.over_lower.name)>>
			As you go to hang your <<print _overClothes>>, you remember that you're <<print _naked>> underneath.
		<</if>>

		<br><br>
		<<npc River>><<person1>>
		River's eyes narrow as you glance at <<him>>. "You can't be trying to attend my lesson without a uniform. Go see the head."
		<br><br>
		<<pubfameComplete "river">>
		<!--<<link [[Hang up coat|]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
		<br><br> good starting point for when you can go to class naked-->
		<<link [[Next|Hallways]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
		<br><br>
	<<elseif wearingSchoolOutfit() and !pcAreArmsBound("right")>>
		<<if $daily.school.attended.housekeeping>>
			You rejoin the housekeeping lesson,
			<<if $worn.over_upper.name isnot "naked" or $worn.over_lower.name isnot "naked" or $worn.over_head.name isnot "naked">>
				hang your coat at the back of the class
				<<undressOverClothes "housekeepingClassroom">>
			<</if>>
			and take your seat.
		<<elseif Time.minute lt 5>>
			<<if modLISelected("Poppy") and Time.days gte 21 and C.npc.Poppy and C.npc.Poppy.init isnot 1 and ($poppySeen is undefined or !Array.isArray($poppySeen) or !$poppySeen.includes("talk_intro"))>>
				<<poppyFirstMeetingInit>><<npc Poppy>><<person1>>
				You enter the housekeeping classroom. River and a stranger are preparing at the front of the room while the seats fill.
				<<if $worn.over_upper.name isnot "naked" or $worn.over_lower.name isnot "naked" or $worn.over_head.name isnot "naked">>
					<<undressOverClothes "housekeepingClassroom">>
					You hang your coat at the back of the class and take your seat.
				<</if>>
				<<if $awarelevel gte 5>>
					<br>
					"Alright class," River starts. "From today on, Poppy will be my teaching assistant." 
					<br><br>
					River gestures to the person beside <<nnpc_him "River">>. Poppy has beautiful, natural crimson red hair. Only with your eyes can you see that <<he>> has a pair of fox ears, a fluffy tail, a broken halo and a pair of ink black wings folded neatly behind <<him>>. 
					<br><br>
					Poppy smiles at the students and waves at them. The students are immediately charmed by <<his>> charisma and start whispering amongst themselves.
				<<else>>
					<br>
					"Alright class," River starts. "From today on, Poppy will be my teaching assistant." River gestures to the person beside <<nnpc_him "River">>. Poppy has beautiful, natural crimson red hair. 
					<br><br>
					Something about <<him>> makes your focus falter, as if <span class="navy">something</span> is flickering just beyond your vision. The students are immediately charmed by <<his>> charisma and start whispering amongst themselves.
				<</if>>
			<<else>>
				You enter the housekeeping classroom.
				<<npc River>><<person1>>
				River is preparing at the front of the room while the seats fill.
				<<if $worn.over_upper.name isnot "naked" or $worn.over_lower.name isnot "naked" or $worn.over_head.name isnot "naked">>
					<<undressOverClothes "housekeepingClassroom">>
					You hang your coat at the back of the class and take your seat.
				<</if>>
			<</if>>
		<<else>>
			You enter the housekeeping classroom.
			<<npc River>><<person1>>
			River cuts off mid-sentence to regard you.
			<<if $daily.school.housekeepingExcused>>
				<<run delete $daily.school.housekeepingExcused>>
				"Sit down and try to catch up." <<He>> doesn't mention your tardiness.
			<<else>>
				"You're late. Maybe some time in detention will prevent future tardiness."
				<<gdelinquency>>
				<<detention 1>>
			<</if>>
			<br><br>
			You
			<<if $worn.over_upper.name isnot "naked" or $worn.over_lower.name isnot "naked" or $worn.over_head.name isnot "naked">>
				hang your coat at the back of the class and
				<<undressOverClothes "mathsClassroom">>
			<</if>>
			take a seat as River continues.
		<</if>>
		<br><br>

		<<pubfameComplete "river">>
		<<link [[Next|Housekeeping Lesson]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
		<br>
	<<elseif pcAreArmsBound("any") or $feetuse is "bound">>
		<<npc River>><<person1>>
		River's eyes narrow as <<he>> sees your bound <<boundBodyParts>>.
		"And another one. Look, whatever silly game you're playing needs to stop. You're not coming in here tied up like that. Go see the head."
		<br><br>

		<<pubfameComplete "river">>
		<<link [[Next|Hallways]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
		<br><br>
	<<else>>
		<<npc River>><<person1>>
		River's eyes narrow as you enter. "You can't attend my lesson without a uniform. Go see the head."
		<br><br>

		<<pubfameComplete "river">>
		<<link [[Next|Hallways]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
		<br><br>
	<</if>>
<<elseif $schoollesson is 1 and [3, 5].includes(Time.weekDay)>>
	<<npc River>><<person1>>
	<<if $daily.school.housekeepingInterrupted is 1>>
		You enter the housekeeping classroom. River stops speaking abruptly and looks your way. "You again? Get out." <<He>> shuts the door on you.
		<<detention 1>><<gdelinquency>>
		<br><br>

		<<link [[Next|Hallways]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
	<<else>>
		<<set $daily.school.housekeepingInterrupted to 1>>
		You enter the housekeeping classroom. River stops speaking abruptly and looks your way. "Yes, what is it?" It seems you've interrupted the lesson.
		<br><br>
		<<pubfameComplete "river">>

		<<link [[Apologise|Housekeeping Classroom Apology]]>><<trauma 1>><<stress 1>><</link>><<gstress>><<gtrauma>>
		<br>
		<<if $trauma gte 1>>
			<<link [[Mock|Housekeeping Classroom Mock]]>><<status 1>><<stress -12>><</link>><<lstress>><<gcool>><<gdelinquency>>
			<br>
		<</if>>
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	<<if modLISelected("Poppy")>>
		<<run poppySchedule()>>
	<</if>>
	<<if modLISelected("Poppy") and C.npc.Poppy and C.npc.Poppy.init is 1 and T.poppy_location is "housekeepingClassroom" and T.poppy_location_message is "prep">>
		<<set $daily.poppy.hkClassroomVisits to typeof $daily.poppy.hkClassroomVisits is "number" ? $daily.poppy.hkClassroomVisits : 0>>
		<<set $daily.poppy.hkClassroomLocked to $daily.poppy.hkClassroomLocked ? 1 : 0>>
		<<if $daily.poppy.hkClassroomLocked is 1>>
			You try to enter the housekeeping classroom. The door is locked.
			<br><br>
			<<getouticon>><<link [[Leave|Hallways]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
		<<elseif Array.isArray(_poppyStatus) and _poppyStatus.includes("LowPatience")>>
			<<set $daily.poppy.hkClassroomLocked to 1>>
			<<npc Poppy>><<person1>>
			When you enter the housekeeping classroom, Poppy looks up from <<his>> paperwork. <<He>> doesn't seem happy to see you.
			<br><br>
			"I'm busy right now. If you need anything, please go seek River." Poppy ushers you out of the classroom and locks the door.
			<<poppyOpiumPulse>>
			<<getouticon>><<link [[Leave|Hallways]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
		<<else>>
			<<set $daily.poppy.hkClassroomVisits to $daily.poppy.hkClassroomVisits + 1>>
			<<npc Poppy>><<person1>>
			<<if $daily.poppy.hkClassroomVisits is 1>>
				When you enter the housekeeping classroom, Poppy looks up from <<his>> paperwork and smiles. "Is there anything I can do for you?"
				<<poppyOpiumPulse>>
				<<socialiseicon "ask">><<link [[Ask for help with your housekeeping skills (0:30)|Housekeeping Classroom Poppy Help]]>><<pass 30>><</link>><<ghousekeeping>>
				<br>
				<<getouticon>><<link [[Leave|Hallways]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
			<<elseif $daily.poppy.hkClassroomVisits is 2>>
				Poppy looks up from <<his>> paperwork. "Did... you forget something?"
				<<poppyOpiumPulse>>
				<<socialiseicon "ask">><<link [[Ask for help with your housekeeping skills (0:30)|Housekeeping Classroom Poppy Help]]>><<pass 30>><</link>><<ghousekeeping>>
				<br>
				<<getouticon>><<link [[Leave|Hallways]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
			<<elseif (typeof C.npc.Poppy.lust is "number" and C.npc.Poppy.lust gte 60)>>
				<<npcincr Poppy patience -5>>
				<<set $daily.poppy.hkClassroomLocked to 1>>
				As you enter the housekeeping classroom once more, Poppy grabs you by the wrist and throws you against the nearest wall, pinning both hands beside your head. 
				<br><br>
				"You're such a pain in the ass, are you really this desperate for my attention?" <<He>> scowls.
				<<poppyOpiumPulse>>
				<<link [[Kiss|Housekeeping Classroom Poppy Kiss]]>><</link>>
				<br>
				<<link [[Apologise|Housekeeping Classroom Poppy Apologise]]>><</link>>
			<<else>>
				<<npcincr Poppy patience -5>>
				<<set $daily.poppy.hkClassroomLocked to 1>>
				Poppy looks up from <<his>> paperwork with an annoyed sigh. "Please stop disturbing me unless it's something important." 
				<br><br>
				Poppy ushers you out of the classroom and locks the door.<<delinquency 1>><<gdelinquency>>
				<<poppyOpiumPulse>>
				<<getouticon>><<link [[Leave|Hallways]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
				<br>
			<</if>>
		<</if>>
	<<else>>
		You are in the housekeeping classroom. A large portion is dedicated to a kitchen.
		<br><br>
		<<if $arousal gte $arousalmax>>
			<<orgasmLocation "emptyClassroom">>
		<</if>>
		<<storeon "housekeepingClassroom" "check">>
		<<if _store_check is 1>>
			<<storeon "housekeepingClassroom">>
			You take your coat at the back of the class.
			<br><br>
		<</if>>
		<<exhibitionclassroom>>

		/* Commented out because it looks really weird with the kitchen UI. Maybe something unique could be done here?
		<<emptyClassroomMasturbationIntro>> */

		River allows students to use the kitchen while lessons aren't in session, though woe betide those who don't clean up after themselves.
		<br><br>

		<<ingredientsSupplied "salt" "vegetable_oil" "bottle_of_milk" "white_wine" "flour" "oats" "sugar">>
		<br><br>

		<<kitchenDisplay>>
		<<if $cookbook is true>>
			<<set _baseTime to Math.max(180 - (6 * Math.round($housekeeping / 50)), 10)>>
			<<set _timeString to getTimeString(_baseTime)>>
			<br><br>
			<<housekeeping_exam_select>>
			<<if $chosen_recipe isnot "none">>
				<span class="gold">You can teach yourself a recipe from your cookbook here.</span> You flip open the book and land on a recipe for <<print $chosen_recipe.replace(/_/g," ")>>.<br><br>
				<<link [["Learn something new (" + _timeString + ")"|Kitchen Self Teach]]>><<pass _baseTime>><<housekeeping 1 1000>><</link>><<ghousekeeping 1000>>
			<<else>>
				There's no more recipes you can learn.
			<</if>>
			<br>
		<</if>>

	<<crimeicon "mark">><<link [[Steal|Housekeeping Kitchen Steal]]>><</link>>
	<br><br>
	<<getouticon>><<link [[Leave the room (0:01)|Hallways]]>><<kitchenExit>><<pass 1>><</link>>
	<br>
	<</if>>
<</if>>

:: Housekeeping Lesson
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">><<schooleffects>><<effects>>
<<if modLISelected("Poppy") and Time.days gte 21 and C.npc.Poppy and C.npc.Poppy.init isnot 1 and ($poppySeen is undefined or !Array.isArray($poppySeen) or !$poppySeen.includes("talk_intro"))>>
	<<poppyFirstMeetingInit>><<npc Poppy>><<person1>>
	You slip into the housekeeping classroom just as River begins the lesson.
	<br><br>
	<<if $awarelevel gte 5>>
		"Before we begin," River says, gesturing to the person beside <<nnpc_him "River">>, "this is Poppy, my new teaching assistant." Poppy has beautiful, natural crimson red hair. 
		<br><br>
		Only with your eyes can you see that <<he>> has a pair of fox ears, a fluffy tail, a broken halo and a pair of ink black wings folded neatly behind <<him>>. Poppy smiles and gives the class a lazy wave.
	<<else>>
		"Before we begin," River says, gesturing to the person beside <<nnpc_him "River">>, “this is Poppy, my new teaching assistant.” Poppy has beautiful, natural crimson red hair. 
		<br><br>
		Something about <<him>> makes your focus falter, as if <span class="navy">something</span> is flickering just beyond your vision. Poppy smiles and gives the class a lazy wave.
	<</if>>
	<br><br><<endevent>>
<<else>>
	<<set $daily.school.attended.housekeeping to true>>
<</if>>

<<if Time.weekDay is 5 and Time.minute gte 37>>
	"Everyone to the kitchen," River says. "It's time for an exam."<<gstress>><<stress 6>>
	<br><br>

	<<npc River>><<person1>>
	<<housekeeping_exam_select>>
	<<if $chosen_recipe isnot "none">>
		<<exam "housekeeping">>
	<</if>>
	<br><br>

	<<if $chosen_recipe is "none">>
		River gestures for you to approach. "You know all this already," <<he>> says. "Set up the projector for me. Choose any recipe, the class needs each of them."
		<br><br>
		You approach the projector. Beside it are a number of slides, each containing instructions for a particular dish. What sort of recipe should the class be tested on?
		<br><br>

		<<link [[Something sweet|Housekeeping Exam Assistant Sweet]]>><</link>>
		<br>
		<<link [[Something savoury|Housekeeping Exam Assistant Savoury]]>><</link>>
		<br>
		<<link [[Something spicy|Housekeeping Exam Assistant Spicy]]>><</link>>
		<br>
	<<else>>
		Students take their places in the kitchen as River fiddles with a projector. A recipe is displayed on a board.
		<<recipe_exam_description $chosen_recipe>>
		<<He>> taps the board. "You have twenty minutes. Go."
		<br><br>

		<<endevent>>
		<<if $arousal gte $arousalmax>>
			<<set _teacher to "River">>
			<<orgasmLocation "classroom">>
		<</if>>

		<<link [[Focus|Housekeeping Exam]]>><<stress 6>><<set $phase to 0>><<set $exam_chance += 5>><</link>><<gstress>><<passPercent 5>>
		<br>
		<<link [[Try to relax|Housekeeping Exam]]>><<set $phase to 1>><</link>>
		<br>
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	<<if Time.minute lt 5>>
		The housekeeping lesson begins. How do you want to conduct yourself?
		<br><br>
	<<else>>
		The housekeeping lesson continues. How do you want to conduct yourself?
		<br><br>
	<</if>>
	<<if $arousal gte $arousalmax>>
		<<set _teacher to "River">>
		<<orgasmLocation "classroom">>
	<</if>>

	<<icon "housekeeping.png">><<link [[Focus on the lesson|Housekeeping Lesson Focus]]>><</link>><<gstress>><<ghousekeeping>>
	<br>
	<<socialiseicon>><<link [[Socialise with classmates|Housekeeping Lesson Socialise]]>><</link>><<gcool>><<ltrauma>><<lstress>><<gharass>>
	<br>
	<<daydreamicon>><<link [[Daydream|Housekeeping Lesson Daydream]]>><</link>><<lstress>><<ltiredness>><<lharass>>
	<br>
	<<if $tiredness gte (C.tiredness.max / 5) * 3>>
		<<bedicon "zzz">><<link [[Sleep at your desk|Housekeeping Lesson Sleep]]>><</link>><<ltiredness>>
		<br>
	<</if>>
	<<if hasSexStat("exhibitionism", 4)>>
		<<skinicon "masturbate">><<link [[Masturbate|Housekeeping Lesson Masturbate]]>><<set $masturbationstart to 1>><</link>><<exhibitionist4>>
		<br>
	<</if>>
<</if>>

:: Housekeeping Classroom Apology
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">><<schooleffects>><<effects>>

Embarrassed, you apologise and leave.
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Hallways]]>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: Housekeeping Classroom Mock
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">><<schooleffects>><<effects>>

You mock the teacher. "Sorry for interrupting <<sir>>, I'll let you get back to putting your class to sleep." Laughter erupts among the seated students.
<br><br>

River is not so amused. "You've made a mistake. Get out."
<<gdelinquency>>
<br><br>
<<detention 1>><<npcincr River love -1>>
<<link [[Next|Hallways]]>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: Housekeeping Lesson Focus
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">><<schooleffects>><<effects>>
<<towelup>>
<<if modLISelected("Poppy")>><<run poppySchedule()>><</if>>
<<if random(1,100) lte 20 and modLISelected("Poppy") and C.npc.Poppy and C.npc.Poppy.init is 1>>
	<<npc Poppy>><<person1>><<advancelesson>>
	You focus on listening to the teacher and studying the material. It's hard going, but you think you're making progress.
	<br><br>
	<<housekeeping _lesson_progress>>
	<<if _dolp_desk_stress>><<stress _dolp_desk_stress>><<else>><<stress _lesson_progress>><</if>>
	As you work, a pair of hands rest against your shoulders. 
	<br><br>
	You turn around to see Poppy smiling at you. "Do you need any guidance?"
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Say yes|Housekeeping Lesson Focus Poppy Yes]]>><</link>><<glove>><<ghousekeeping>><<handholdingvirginitywarning>>
	<br>
	<<link [[Say you're fine|Housekeeping Lesson Focus Poppy No]]>><</link>>
<<else>>
	You focus on listening to the teacher and studying the material. It's hard going, but you think you're making progress.
	<br><br>
	<<advancelesson>><<housekeeping _lesson_progress>>
	<<if _dolp_desk_stress>><<stress _dolp_desk_stress>><<else>><<stress _lesson_progress>><</if>>
	<<if $phase is 1>>
		<<lessonEnd "housekeepingClassroom">>
	<<else>>
		<<lessonEvents "housekeeping">>
	<</if>>
<</if>>

:: Housekeeping Lesson Socialise
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">><<schooleffects>><<effects>>

<<towelup>>

<<if $cool gte ($coolmax / 5 * 2)>>
	You do the bare minimum of work, focusing instead on trying to endear yourself to your classmates. You soon become the centre of attention.
<<elseif $cool gte ($coolmax / 5)>>
	You do the bare minimum of work, focusing instead on trying to endear yourself to your classmates.
<<else>>
	You do the bare minimum of work, focusing instead on trying to endear yourself to your classmates. Most avoid interacting with you.
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<status 1>>

<<advancelesson>>
<<set _stress to _lesson_progress * -1>>
<<stress _stress>>
<<set _trauma to _lesson_progress * -0.5>>
<<trauma _trauma>>

<<if $phase is 1>>
	<<lessonEnd "housekeepingClassroom">>
<<else>>
	<<lessonEvents "housekeeping" 2>>
<</if>>

:: Housekeeping Lesson Daydream
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">><<schooleffects>><<effects>>

<<towelup>>

<<if $trauma gte (($traumamax / 10) * 7)>>
	You keep to yourself, afraid that one wrong move will result in the whole class molesting you.
<<elseif $trauma gte (($traumamax / 10) * 2)>>
	You focus on your own thoughts, trying to keep the creeping anxiety at bay.
<<else>>
	You don't really pay attention to the lesson, instead idly staring out the window and thinking about what you'll do after school.
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<advancelesson>>
<<set _stress to _lesson_progress * -1>>
<<stress _stress>>


<<if $phase is 1>>
	<<lessonEnd "housekeepingClassroom">>
<<else>>
	<<lessonEvents "housekeeping" 0.5>>
<</if>>

:: Housekeeping Lesson Sleep
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">><<schooleffects>><<effects>>

You rest your head on the desk while River <<print either("demonstrates a sewing technique", "enthuses about the importance of kitchen hygiene", "explains the finer points of a particular recipe", "lectures about household finances")>>. Your eyes soon close, just for a moment, before you open them again. You struggle to stay awake, but the desk is just too comfy.
<br><br>
<<towelup>>
<<tiredness -12>>
<<advancelesson>>

<<if $phase is 1>>
	<<lessonEnd "housekeepingClassroom" "sleep">>
<<else>>
	<<eventshousekeepingsleep>>
<</if>>

:: Housekeeping Kitchen Steal
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">><<effects>>
You look through the cabinets. Most of the ingredients you use during classes are here. 
<<if Time.schoolDay>>
	<<if $schoolstate is "early" or $schoolstate is "lunch">>
		Nobody usually comes here at this hour, so it should be easy.
		<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 400>>
	<<elseif $schoolstate is "late">>
		You don't think anybody will come in, but there is always the possibility.
		<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 500>>
	<<else>>
		You must be quick. Somebody may come in at any point.
		<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 800>>
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	Nobody is around.
	<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 300>>
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<ingredientsSuppliesSteal "salt" "vegetable_oil" "bottle_of_milk" "white_wine" "flour" "oats" "sugar">>
<br>
<<icon "housekeeping.png">><<link [[Back|Housekeeping Classroom]]>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: school Kitchen Steal Result
<<effects>>

<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 300>><<skulduggerycheck>>
<br><br>

<<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1>>
	The <<recipe_name $phase "plural">> are behind some jars, so you move them out of your way as quietly as possible. <<tending_pick $phase 3 6>>
	<br>
	You probably shouldn't take more, or River will notice too much is missing.
	<br><br>
	
	<<icon "housekeeping.png">><<link [[Walk away|Housekeeping Classroom]]>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<ingredientsSuppliesSteal "salt" "vegetable_oil" "bottle_of_milk" "white_wine" "flour" "oats" "sugar">>
<<else>>
	<<if Time.schoolDay>>
		<<if $schoolstate is "early" or $schoolstate is "lunch" or $schoolstate is "late">>
			<<generatey1>><<person1>>
			<<set _tellTarget to random(1, 6)>>
			The <<recipe_name $phase "plural">> are behind some jars, so you move them out of your way as quietly as possible. You're reaching for them when you hear a gasp behind you. You turn around.
			<br><br>
			"Are you stealing ingredients?" the <<person>> exclaims. "That's not okay! I'm telling <<switch _tellTarget>><<case 1>>the head<<case 2>>the <<nnpc_title "Leighton">><<case 3>>Leighton<<case 4>>a teacher<<default>>River<</switch>>!"
			<br><br>
			<<He>> runs out before you can say anything. <<detention 1>><<gdelinquency>>
			<br><br>
			You look at the <<recipe_name $phase>> in your hand. You'll still be in trouble even if you leave it here, but it will be worse if you take it with you.
			<br><br><<set $weekly.theft.school[$phase] to false>>
			<<link [[Leave it behind|Housekeeping Leave]]>><</link>>
			<br>
			<<link [[Take it anyway|Housekeeping Take]]>><<detention 4>><</link>><<ggdelinquency>>
		<<else>>
			<<npc River>><<person1>>
			The <<recipe_name $phase "plural">> are behind some jars, so you move them out of your way as quietly as possible. You don't manage to take them before you hear someone coming in.
			<br><br>
			"Are you trying to steal ingredients?" You turn around and find yourself face to face with River. <<His>> eyes narrow. "Put the <<recipe_name $phase>> back. Perhaps a detention will teach you not to steal."<<npcincr River love -1>><<llove>><<detention 6>><<ggdelinquency>>
			<<set $weekly.theft.school[$phase] to false>><br><br>
			<<link [[Leave the room (0:01)|Hallways]]>><<handheldon>><<pass 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
		<</if>>
	<<else>>
		<<beastNEWinit 1 cat>>
		You move some jars out of the way to reach for <<recipe_name $phase "plural">>, but accidentally knock them together. You freeze, and hear a low growl behind you.
		<<beastNEWinit 1 cat>>
		<<if ($monster is 1 or $settings.bestialityEnabled) and not ($NPCList[0] and $NPCList[0].lewdBlocked)>>
			A large <<beasttype>> pounces on you from the shadows, forcing you to your knees. The jar drops, shattering on the floor.
			<br><br>
			<<if (($cat gte 6 and $transformationParts.traits.activeTF is "disabled") or $transformationParts.traits.activeTF is "cat")>>
				<<link [[Hiss|School Housekeeping Hiss]]>><</link>><<cat>>
				<br>
			<</if>>
			<<link [[Fight|School Housekeeping Cat]]>><<set $molestationstart to 1>><</link>>
			<br>
		<<else>>
			A large cat pounces on you from the shadows, making you drop the jar. It shatters on the floor. You manage to escape, but not without injury. You leave quite a mess behind you.<<crimeUp 5 "destruction">><<crime "destruction">>
			<<beastescape>>
			<br><br>
			<<link [[Next|Housekeeping Classroom]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
			<br>
		<</if>>
	<</if>>
<</if>>

:: Housekeeping Leave
<<effects>>
You put down the <<recipe_name $phase "plural">>. At least now there's little evidence it was you. Still, you should probably leave and not try again for some time. 
<<set $weekly.theft.school[$phase] to false>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[Leave the room (0:01)|Hallways]]>><<handheldon>><<pass 1>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: Housekeeping Take
<<effects>>
You pick the <<recipe_name $phase>> anyways. <<tending_pick $phase 3 6>> You should still leave quickly before you get in more trouble. And probably not return any time soon.
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[Leave the room (0:01)|Hallways]]>><<pass 1>><</link>>

:: School Housekeeping Hiss
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">><<effects>>
You hiss at the <<beasttype>>. <<bHe>> backs away from you, <<bhis>> ears turned back. You stare at <<bhim>> and unleash your deepest meow. <<bHe>> growls back, but <<bhis>> face relaxes. <<bHe>> leaps onto the windowsill and disappears behind it.
<br><br>
You look around at the shattered jar on the ground. The <<recipe_name $phase "plural">> you wanted to steal lie on the ground mixed with glass. Picking any of it would be too dangerous, but it's enough to be passed as a simple accident. If you clean it up, nobody should bat an eye on the destruction you caused.
<br><br>
<<link [[Clean it up|Housekeeping Classroom Sweep]]>><<endevent>><</link>><br>
<<link [[Leave it|Housekeeping Classroom Leave]]>><<detention 2>><<endevent>><</link>><<gdelinquency>>

:: Housekeeping Classroom Sweep
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">><<effects>>
You pick up the broom and sweep the glass and remains of <<recipe_name $phase "plural">> off the floor. It doesn't take you long to take care of it.
<br><br>
<<crimeicon "mark">><<link [[Steal more|Housekeeping Kitchen Steal]]>><</link>><br>
<<icon "housekeeping.png">><<link [[Walk away|Housekeeping Classroom]]>><</link>>

:: Housekeeping Classroom Leave
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">><<effects>>
You decide it's better to leave the mess behind. It's not your problem anymore.
<br><br>
<<crimeicon "mark">><<link [[Steal more|Housekeeping Kitchen Steal]]>><</link>><br>
<<icon "housekeeping.png">><<link [[Walk away|Housekeeping Classroom]]>><<endevent>><</link>>


